    "content": [
        {
            "text": "LIST OF COLLECTED PERSONAL DATA AND COLLECTION METHOD"
        },
        {
            "text": ""
        },
        {
            "text": "Activision Publishing, Inc. (hereinafter referred to as \"Activision\", located in the United States, contact: privacy@activision.com) collects (including receiving data from group companies and platform service providers) and uses your personal data to the minimum extent that is necessary to provide our services to you. Activision transfers collected personal data overseas upon your purchase and usage of services by online transmission to provide its services. You have a right to refuse this consent form. Even when you do not enter personal data that is optional, there is no limitation on your use of our services. However, Activision’s service shall be restricted if you don't agree to this essential consent for PI processing."
        },
        {
            "text": ""
        },
        {
            "text": ""
        },
        {
            "text": "^BRequired Items Collected Through ^R^BPlatform ^R^BS^R^Bervice ^R^BP^R^Broviders^R^B ^R"
        },
        {
            "text": "Birth date, Account Name and Account ID/e-mail, Device ID ",
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0",
            "indentation": {}
        },
        {
            "text": "Regional information",
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0",
            "indentation": {}
        },
        {
            "text": "Relevant service purchase and usage information",
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0",
            "indentation": {}
        },
        {
            "text": ""
        },
        {
            "text": ""
        },
        {
            "text": "^BRequired^R^B Items Collected by ^R^BActivision (for Activision A^R^Bccount^R^B)^R"
        },
        {
            "text": "Name, Birth date, Email address, Password, Region, Display user name (Activision ID) and Phone number (two factor authentication for certain games, such as free game or game pass trial)",
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0",
            "indentation": {}
        },
        {
            "text": ""
        },
        {
            "text": "^BO^R^Bptional ^R^BItems Collected by ^R^BActivision ^R"
        },
        {
            "text": "Email address:^B for ^R^Br^R^Beceiving ^R^Bp^R^Bromotional Information^R",
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0",
            "indentation": {}
        },
        {
            "text": "^BPhone number^R",
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0",
            "indentation": {}
        },
        {
            "text": "^B-^R^B for receiving ^R^Bautomated text alerts regarding your account, including account, security and gift alerts, and other system messages and promotional texts upon your consent^R",
            "indentation": {
                "left": "720"
            }
        },
        {
            "text": "^B-^R^B for two factor authentication^R",
            "indentation": {
                "left": "720"
            }
        },
        {
            "text": ""
        },
        {
            "text": "^BAutomatically Collected Items^R"
        },
        {
            "text": "Gameplay Data (inventory, progression, match stats, etc.), IP address, unauthorized usage log, access log, cookie, websites visited before and after you use a Property, Browser type and language, communications (including without limitation chat, text, or voice communications), Hardware and software information, usage data, purchase histories, advertising ID, non-personal identifiers, Social Media data, Activities on your device.",
            "indentation": {},
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0"
        },
        {
            "text": "PURPOSE OF COLLECTION AND USAGE OF PERSONAL DATA"
        },
        {
            "text": ""
        },
        {
            "text": "We use the information we collect to operate Activision Services; "
        },
        {
            "text": "Perform the services, and personalizing your experience on our Properties",
            "indentation": {},
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0"
        },
        {
            "text": "Commercial purposes, such as facilitating purchases of Activision products or service, or sending newsletters, marketing, surveys, and to provide you with targeted advertising",
            "indentation": {},
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0"
        },
        {
            "text": "Facilitate purchases of Activision products or services",
            "indentation": {},
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0"
        },
        {
            "text": "Interact with Customer Service",
            "indentation": {},
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0"
        },
        {
            "text": "Detect security incidents, secure our Properties and other security features such as two-factor authentication functionality, etc.",
            "indentation": {},
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0"
        },
        {
            "text": "Undertaking activities to verify and maintain the quality of our service, such as preventing cheating and bad behavior",
            "indentation": {},
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0"
        },
        {
            "text": ""
        },
        {
            "text": "For improvement of users' game experience and management of users' in-game relationship, non-identifiable data along with Display name (Activision ID) may be disclosed to other users through open API or in-game interface, including game data generated during user's usage of Activision's services."
        },
        {
            "text": "PERIOD OF RETENTION AND USAGE"
        },
        {
            "text": ""
        },
        {
            "text": "Activision will hold your personal information until termination of service."
        },
        {
            "text": "In addition, if Activision needs to retain such data to comply with relevant laws or regulations, Activision will retain the data for the period set under such laws or regulations."
        },
        {
            "text": "For any privacy policy or personal data-related inquiries, please send an e-mail to privacy@activision.com."
        },
        {
            "text": "Notification for Personal Data Overseas Transfer"
        },
        {
            "text": ""
        },
        {
            "text": "Activision transfer collected personal data overseas as below, and this is essential for service. "
        },
        {
            "text": ""
        },
        {
            "text": "^BFor Stable Service Provision^R"
        },
        {
            "text": "Company: Amazon.com Inc. (location: United States, contact: Amazon Customer Service https://aws.amazon.com/contact-us/?nc1=h_ls), Google LLC (location: United States, contact: Google Cloud Customer Service https://cloud.google.com/contact)",
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0",
            "indentation": {}
        },
        {
            "text": "Items: any personal data collected during your use of service",
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0",
            "indentation": {}
        },
        {
            "text": "Period: until termination of agreement",
            "lvl_text": "▪",
            "level": "0",
            "indentation": {}
        }
    ]
